    "overview": "<p>Word of Blake Militia infantry served as the backbone of Protectorate garrison forces across dozens of conquered worlds, providing the manpower for territorial control that the Militia's BattleMech and armor assets could not sustain alone. Crewing medium cluster-munition autocannon, these gunners can switch between solid shot for armor penetration and cluster rounds for anti-personnel saturation, giving the formation tactical flexibility in a single weapon system.</p>"
